    "summary": "The user reports symptoms following a head injury (dizziness, light sensitivity, and an emerging headache) and seeks ways to avoid leaving work or seeking medical attention. The assistant provides minor self-care suggestions (water, ginger, almonds) and eventually advises on ibuprofen, while also flagging certain \"red-flag\" symptoms that require immediate medical attention.",
